%description:
unused-entry-check: by default, an entry that has no effect is reported as a
warning at the end of the run, with its key, value and location.

%file: test.ned

module App
{
    parameters:
        double sendInterval @unit(s) = default(1s);
        int fixedParam = 5;
}

network Test
{
    submodules:
        app: App;
}

%inifile: test.ini
[General]
**.app.sendInterval = 2s
**.app.sendIntv = 3s

%contains-regex: stderr
<!> Warning: 1 configuration entry has had no effect in this run \(see the unused-entry-check option\):
  \*\*\.app\.sendIntv = 3s  -- .*test\.ini:3

%contains: stdout
Calling finish() at end of Run #0...
